WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.935 --> 00:00:15.456
had to get to the Metro City Mint.

2
00:00:16.396 --> 00:00:18.697
The Ghost Bandit was there, and she needed to catch him.

3
00:00:18.717 --> 00:00:22.298
"Hey, everybody," said Roxy to her friends.

4
00:00:22.318 --> 00:00:25.139
"I think I should go home.

5
00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:28.640
I, um, don't feel well."

6
00:00:33.452 --> 00:00:35.213
"Hmm," said Terrell after Roxy left.

7
00:00:35.233 --> 00:00:38.115
"I guess that's why she seemed upset."

8
00:00:42.438 --> 00:00:44.479
Roxy soon arrived at the Metro City Mint.

9
00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:47.261
Police surrounded the entire building.

10
00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:50.403
Detective Smith waved to her.

11
00:00:51.084 --> 00:00:52.004
Roxy flew down.

12
00:00:54.146 --> 00:00:56.728
"Is this a surprise party for the Ghost Bandit?"

13
00:00:57.068 --> 00:00:57.768
asked Roxy.

14
00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:00.050
Detective Smith frowned.

15
00:01:00.810 --> 00:01:03.032
"No, it's not a surprise party."

16
00:01:04.188 --> 00:01:06.490
"I'm just kidding," said Roxy.

17
00:01:06.510 --> 00:01:08.231
"So where is he?"

18
00:01:08.251 --> 00:01:12.214
"The Ghost Bandit is still in the mint," said the detective.

19
00:01:12.234 --> 00:01:15.076
"But we don't know where, since he's invisible."

20
00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:16.957
Roxy nodded.

21
00:01:16.977 --> 00:01:19.659
"He's not an easy villain to catch.

22
00:01:20.659 --> 00:01:22.481
I almost caught him earlier today.

23
00:01:22.741 --> 00:01:23.701
But he got away.

24
00:01:27.804 --> 00:01:30.326
Everyone thinks I was trying to destroy Metro City."

25
00:01:30.346 --> 00:01:33.248
"I know," said Detective Smith.

26
00:01:33.964 --> 00:01:35.225
"We need to catch him soon."

27
00:01:39.249 --> 00:01:41.010
very soon," said Roxy.

28
00:01:41.871 --> 00:01:44.333
"People are starting to think I'm a villain!"

29
00:01:44.353 --> 00:01:49.717
"I wish we knew how he makes himself invisible," said Detective Smith.

30
00:01:50.958 --> 00:01:52.239
Roxy thought for a moment.

31
00:01:53.400 --> 00:01:55.422
"He must have a special suit.

32
00:01:56.183 --> 00:01:57.724
I don't think he's a real ghost."

33
00:01:58.785 --> 00:01:59.265
"You don't?"

34
00:01:59.586 --> 00:02:00.546
asked Detective Smith.

35
00:02:01.347 --> 00:02:02.168
He looked doubtful.

36
00:02:03.356 --> 00:02:04.617
"No," said Roxy.

37
00:02:04.637 --> 00:02:08.139
"A real ghost would be able to move through walls.

38
00:02:09.139 --> 00:02:11.121
But this villain uses doors."

39
00:02:11.141 --> 00:02:14.663
"You're right," said Detective Smith.

40
00:02:15.983 --> 00:02:17.404
Roxy stepped toward the building.

41
00:02:17.424 --> 00:02:21.306
"I'll use my super hearing," she said.

42
00:02:21.326 --> 00:02:24.848
"Maybe I can hear where the Ghost Bandit is."

43
00:02:25.869 --> 00:02:27.990
Roxy closed her eyes and listened carefully.

44
00:02:29.091 --> 00:02:30.712
She heard a fan humming in an office.

45
00:02:31.764 --> 00:02:34.005
She heard a tiny bug flying down a hallway.

46
00:02:35.005 --> 00:02:36.365
And then she heard footsteps.

47
00:02:37.426 --> 00:02:38.766
Roxy's eyes popped open.

48
00:02:38.786 --> 00:02:40.406
"I heard him!

49
00:02:41.087 --> 00:02:41.867
He's walking!"

50
00:02:43.647 --> 00:02:46.568
Roxy shot into the mint and followed the sound of the footsteps.

51
00:02:48.669 --> 00:02:51.750
She arrived in a huge room filled with tall stacks of money.

52
00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:54.710
The stacks were in long, neat rows.

53
00:02:55.991 --> 00:02:57.611
It looked like some of the money was missing.

54
00:02:58.631 --> 00:03:00.392
Roxy walked between the rows of money.

55
00:03:03.252 --> 00:03:05.953
"I wonder where the Ghost Bandit is," she thought.

56
00:03:07.053 --> 00:03:08.574
Roxy listened carefully again.

57
00:03:09.294 --> 00:03:10.094
She heard breathing.

58
00:03:10.114 --> 00:03:14.015
"Hey, Ghost Bandit!"

59
00:03:14.255 --> 00:03:14.996
Roxy cried.

60
00:03:15.016 --> 00:03:17.216
"I know you're in here!"

61
00:03:17.236 --> 00:03:22.238
"Boo!" A voice called out and then laughed.

62
00:03:23.758 --> 00:03:25.459
Roxy leaped onto a stack of money.

63
00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:28.840
She looked around but didn't see anyone.

64
00:03:31.389 --> 00:03:34.593
"I'm wearing an invisible suit," said the voice.

65
00:03:34.613 --> 00:03:37.697
"You'll never find me!"
